canvas 520 300
label "Mode 5, the live board: people, local agents and remote agents pull work from the shared Bundle (highlighted: decisions, specs, tasks on boards, gates, skills, lessons) through its published surfaces and write to it only as proposals; the fast lane of agent lanes and automatic merges never reaches the slow lane of gates, reviews and decisions, where a person decides"
caption "The highlighted Bundle is the shared pull board itself; every participant reads it and proposes to it, and the dashed border is the line the fast lane can never cross."
box bb 176 24 170 122 "the Bundle as live board|decisions · specs · tasks|boards · gates · skills|lessons · episodes" acc
box people 16 40 120 44 "people"
box local 16 100 120 44 "local agents"
box remote 16 160 120 44 "remote agents"
arrow people bb
arrow local bb
arrow remote bb
box fast 380 24 124 70 "fast lane|agent lanes, auto|merges, refresh"
box boards 380 110 124 44 "boards: claimed_by,|done"
arrow bb fast
arrow fast boards
region slow 176 176 328 96 "slow lane — a person decides"
box gates 190 196 140 60 "gates · reviews|decisions · releases"
box config 348 196 140 60 "procedures · gates|configuration"
arrow bb gates dashed
note "the fast lane runs until the board is done; the slow lane is unreachable from it"
